---
import PageShell from "@app/layouts/PageShell.astro";
import {
  getContentDays,
  getSyllabus,
  padDay,
  upcomingSyllabusDays
} from "@app/site-data";
import type { Locale } from "@lib/schemas/day";
import { alternateLocale, staticPageUrl } from "@lib/static-site/routes";

interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}

const { locale } = Astro.props;
const isZh = locale === "zh";
const [syllabus, days] = await Promise.all([
  getSyllabus(locale),
  getContentDays(locale)
]);
const totalDays = syllabus.blocks.reduce((total, block) => total + block.days.length, 0);
const contentDays = new Map(days.map((day) => [day.day, day]));
const upcoming = upcomingSyllabusDays(syllabus, days, 6);
const nextDay = upcoming[0];
const latestContentDay = days.at(-1)?.day ?? 0;
const compactBlockTitle = (title: string) => title
  .replace(/\s+\+\s+(?:DEEP DIVE|专题深入)\s+\d+[:：].*$/i, "")
  .replace(/\s+\+\s+(?:Capstone|顶点)$/i, "");
---
<PageShell
  locale={locale}
  pageKind="syllabus"
  title={isZh ? "课程表" : "Syllabus"}
  subtitle={isZh ? "十三个模块，一百八十日，每一课都建立在前一课之上。" : "Thirteen blocks, 180 lessons, each building on the day before."}
  eyebrow={isZh ? "关于课程" : "About the course"}
  description={isZh ? "完整的 180 天课程总览，已发布的课程提供在线阅读链接。" : "The complete 180-day course map, with published lessons linked as they arrive."}
  canonicalPath={staticPageUrl(locale, "syllabus")}
  alternatePath={staticPageUrl(alternateLocale(locale), "syllabus")}
>
  <section class="syllabus-brief" aria-label={isZh ? "课程路线简介" : "Route introduction"}>
    <div class="syllabus-brief-copy">
      <p class="lede">{isZh ? "课程表是全书的结构，而不是彼此无关的主题清单。每一天都建立在前一天之上：从信念如何获得信任开始，逐步进入数学、物理、化学、生命、医学、心智、人工智能、经济、社会制度、伦理，以及正在塑造未来的力量。" : "The syllabus is the book's route through the world: not a shelf of unrelated topics, but a sequence of descents where each day gives the next one firmer ground. It begins by asking how belief earns trust, then moves through mathematics, physics, chemistry, life, medicine, mind, artificial intelligence, economics, societies, ethics, and the future."}</p>

      <p>{isZh ? "每一课都遵循同一结构：从易于进入的问题开始，建立核心模型，说明仍在进行的争论，再介绍较新的研究。前沿主张标为「已确立」、「有前景」或「有争议／炒作风险」，以便区分新颖性与证据强度。" : "Every lesson keeps the same internal shape: an accessible entry point, a core model, a live debate, and a walk toward recent research. The frontier is treated with discipline. Claims are marked as established, promising hints, or contested hype; the goal is not to make novelty feel certain, but to show how evidence changes its weight."}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="syllabus-progress" aria-label={isZh ? "课程进度" : "Syllabus progress"}>
      <div>
        <p class="progress-label">{isZh ? "已发布" : "Published now"}</p>
        <p class="progress-number">{isZh ? `${days.length} / ${totalDays} 天` : `${days.length} of ${totalDays} days`}</p>
      </div>
      {nextDay && (
        <div>
          <p class="progress-label">{isZh ? "下一课" : "Next up"}</p>
          <p class="progress-next">{isZh ? `第 ${padDay(nextDay.day)} 日 · ${nextDay.title}` : `Day ${padDay(nextDay.day)} · ${nextDay.title}`}</p>
        </div>
      )}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="syllabus-map" data-syllabus-map aria-labelledby="syllabus-map-title">
    <div class="syllabus-map-head">
      <div>
        <p class="progress-label">{isZh ? "总览" : "Overview"}</p>
        <h2 id="syllabus-map-title">{isZh ? "十三个模块一览" : "Thirteen blocks at a glance"}</h2>
        <p>{isZh ? "各模块以知识依赖关系相接；每一段的高度对应其课程日数。" : "Each block builds on the ones before it; the height of each segment reflects the number of days it covers."}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="syllabus-map-blocks" role="group" aria-label={isZh ? "按模块浏览课程表" : "Browse the syllabus by block"}>
      {syllabus.blocks.map((block, blockIndex) => {
        const published = block.days.filter((day) => contentDays.has(day.day)).length;
        return (
          <button
            class="map-block block-scope"
            type="button"
            data-map-block={block.id.toLowerCase()}
            data-published={published}
            style={`--block-hue:${Math.round(200 + (blockIndex * 100) / Math.max(1, syllabus.blocks.length - 1))};--map-fill:${published / Math.max(1, block.days.length)};--route-days:${block.days.length}`}
            aria-controls={`block-${block.id.toLowerCase()}`}
            aria-pressed="false"
          >
            <span class="map-block-id">{block.id}</span>
            <span class="map-block-copy">
              <span class="map-block-title">{compactBlockTitle(block.title)}</span>
              <span class="map-block-summary">{block.summary}</span>
            </span>
            <span class="map-block-meta">
              <span class="map-block-range">{padDay(block.startDay)}–{padDay(block.endDay)}</span>
              <span class="map-block-progress">{isZh ? `${published}/${block.days.length} 已发布` : `${published}/${block.days.length} published`}</span>
            </span>
            <span class="map-block-fill" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
        );
      })}
    </div>
    <p class="syllabus-map-status" data-map-status aria-live="polite">{isZh ? "选择任意模块查看其中的课程。" : "Select a block to see its lessons."}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="syllabus-index" aria-labelledby="syllabus-index-title">
    <header class="syllabus-index-head">
      <div>
        <h2 id="syllabus-index-title">{isZh ? "逐日课程一览" : "Every lesson, day by day"}</h2>
      </div>
    </header>

    <nav class="syllabus-block-nav" aria-label={isZh ? "课程模块" : "Syllabus blocks"}>
      {syllabus.blocks.map((block, blockIndex) => (
        <a class="block-scope" style={`--block-hue:${Math.round(200 + (blockIndex * 100) / Math.max(1, syllabus.blocks.length - 1))}`} href={`#block-${block.id.toLowerCase()}`}>{isZh ? `模块 ${block.id}` : `Block ${block.id}`}</a>
      ))}
    </nav>

    <div class="depth-chart">
      {syllabus.blocks.map((block, blockIndex) => (
        <section class="syllabus-block block-scope" id={`block-${block.id.toLowerCase()}`} style={`--block-hue:${Math.round(200 + (blockIndex * 100) / Math.max(1, syllabus.blocks.length - 1))}`}>
          <header class="stratum-head">
            <span class="stratum-mark" aria-hidden="true">{block.id}</span>
            <div class="stratum-head-body">
              <p class="stratum-range">{isZh ? `模块 ${block.id} · 第 ${block.startDay}-${block.endDay} 日` : `Block ${block.id} · Days ${block.startDay}-${block.endDay}`}</p>
              <h2>{block.title}</h2>
              <p class="stratum-summary">{block.summary}</p>
            </div>
          </header>
          <ol class="depth-list">
            {block.days.map((day) => {
              const contentDay = contentDays.get(day.day);
              const isHere = nextDay ? day.day === nextDay.day : false;
              return (
                <li class:list={["depth-day", { "is-published": Boolean(contentDay), "is-here": isHere }]}>
                  <span class="depth-num">{padDay(day.day)}</span>
                  <div class="depth-body">
                    <h3 class="depth-title">{contentDay ? <a href={contentDay.url}>{contentDay.title}</a> : day.title}</h3>
                    {contentDay && <p class="depth-summary">{contentDay.summary}</p>}
                    {!contentDay && isHere && <p class="depth-status">{isZh ? "下一课" : "Next up"}</p>}
                  </div>
                </li>
              );
            })}
          </ol>
        </section>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="next-summary" aria-labelledby="what-comes-next">
    <p class="sec-eyebrow">{isZh ? "后续" : "What's next"}</p>
    <h2 id="what-comes-next">{isZh ? "后续课程" : "Coming up"}</h2>
    {nextDay ? (
      <>
        <p>{isZh ? `本书已发布至第 ${padDay(latestContentDay)} 日。下一日是第 ${padDay(nextDay.day)} 日：${nextDay.title}，位于模块 ${nextDay.blockId}。` : `The book has published through Day ${padDay(latestContentDay)}. The next lesson is Day ${padDay(nextDay.day)}: ${nextDay.title}, in Block ${nextDay.blockId}.`}{nextDay.entry && nextDay.model && nextDay.debate ? (isZh ? `切入点：${nextDay.entry}；核心模型：${nextDay.model}；主要争论：${nextDay.debate}。` : ` Entry point: ${nextDay.entry} Core model: ${nextDay.model} Live debate: ${nextDay.debate}`) : nextDay.note ? ` ${nextDay.note}` : ""}</p>
        <ol class="upcoming-list">
          {upcoming.map((day) => (
            <li><span class="upcoming-day">{isZh ? `第 ${padDay(day.day)} 日 · ` : `Day ${padDay(day.day)} · `}</span><span>{day.title}</span></li>
          ))}
        </ol>
        <p>{isZh ? "开篇模块之后，课程从「我们如何知道」转向知识的形式语言：数学、概率、系统、信息与计算。这些工具随后承担起后续章节的重量——物理定律、生命系统、心智、制度以及研究最前沿的争论。" : "After the opening block, the course turns from how we know to the formal languages of knowledge: mathematics, probability, systems, information, and computation. Those tools then do the heavy lifting for the later chapters on physical law, living systems, minds, institutions, and the research frontier."}</p>
      </>
    ) : (
      <p>{isZh ? "全部 180 课已经发布。接下来的工作是维护：收紧链接，刷新前沿主张，并在研究记录变化时更新证据标签。" : "All 180 lessons have been published. The next work is maintenance: tightening links, refreshing frontier claims, and keeping the evidence labels current as the research record changes."}</p>
    )}
  </section>
</PageShell>
